{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39065","headline":"贺赵观文重试及第 · 褚载","name":"贺赵观文重试及第","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"一枝仙桂两回春，始觉文章可致身。\n已把色丝要上第，又将彩笔冠羣伦。\n龙泉再淬方知利，火浣重烧转更新。\n今日街头看御牓，大能荣耀苦心人。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"褚载","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_39065.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39065","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}